                <p class="date">Updated
                    March 11, 2022
                </p>
                
                <p class="orangetext">If you are a consumer or patient please visit
                    <a class="audience-context-switch consumer" href="/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=b5463553-b775-47a3-8d10-31e01ca1ec72&audience=consumer"
                        id="anch_dj_105">this version.</a></p>
                

